  Needs: needs-fixture: unconsented_child_id (active REAL or LEGACY_UNCLASSIFIED profile in seed-org-a-class-1 without pending deletion or revoked consent)
  Expected: 409 / CONSENT_NOT_EFFECTIVE (audited; REAL writes remain blocked even when effective)
